      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "王明，我刚发现一个小问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "什么问题？严重吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "应该不严重，但是这个结果和昨天不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "先别担心。我们从输入的数据开始看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这里的三个数字我都检查过了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那日期呢？有时候日期选错也会影响结果。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "等一下……你说得对，我选成昨天了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那就找到原因了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "原来这么简单，我刚才还很紧张。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "小错误很正常，重要的是及时发现。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在改一下，再重新检查。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc005_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "好。改完以后把前后两个结果比较一下。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
